# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ExamSmasher — environment
#
# There is NOTHING to configure. No file to copy, no keys to create.
#
# Everything runs on your own machine:
#   - syllabus analysis, papers, notes, quiz, plans  -> rule-based engine
#   - the optional in-browser model                  -> downloaded from
#     Hugging Face on first use and cached by the browser
#   - syllabus files (.pdf/.docx/.txt/photo)         -> read by the one
#     server route, `POST /api/extract`, using local parsers + Tesseract OCR
#
# There is no YouTube API key and no LLM key anywhere in the code — search
# links open YouTube's own results page, and no upload or prompt is sent to
# any third party.
#
# If your local `.env.local` still lists YOUTUBE_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY /
# OPENAI_API_KEY / LLM_MODEL, those belong to the old server-side AI: no code
# reads them any more, so you can delete them (the file itself is ignored by
# git either way).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
